# Resend (https://resend.com) — powers the contact form at /contact.
# 1. Create a Resend account and API key.
# 2. Verify a sending domain in Resend (e.g. advanta-group.com) — required
#    before you can send from an @advanta-group.com address. Until then,
#    RESEND_FROM_EMAIL can stay on the Resend sandbox sender below.
# 3. Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values.

RESEND_API_KEY=

# Must be on a domain verified in Resend. Defaults to the Resend sandbox
# sender if unset, which only works for the account owner's own inbox.
RESEND_FROM_EMAIL="Advanta Website <onboarding@resend.dev>"
